  "Animation styles (a test): nine ways to draw the exercise animation, for now only on Zone 2 (\"Easy step-ups or marching\"); every other exercise keeps the mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) and Voxel are three.js scenes; Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) and ASCII (text) are drawn without three.js. All of them play the same movement.": "Mga istilo ng animation (isang pagsubok): siyam na paraan upang iguhit ang animation ng ehersisyo, sa ngayon lamang sa Zone 2 (\"Madaling hakbang o pagmamartsa\"); bawat iba pang ehersisyo ay nagpapanatili ng mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) at Voxel ay three.js na mga eksena; Ang Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) at ASCII (text) ay iginuhit nang walang tatlo.js. Lahat sila ay gumaganap ng parehong paggalaw.",
