  "Spend 2–4 minutes decompressing the spine and building elite grip strength. Includes passive hangs for disc hydration, active hangs for shoulder stability, and farmer's holds. Bryan's grip strength ranks in the top 5% for all ages.": "Gumugol ng 2-4 minuto sa pag-decompress ng gulugod at pagbuo ng elite grip strength. May kasamang passive hang para sa disc hydration, active hangs para sa shoulder stability, at farmer's hold. Ang lakas ng pagkakahawak ni Bryan ay nasa nangungunang 5% para sa lahat ng edad.",
  "Spend 3–4 minutes stimulating bone mineral density through high-impact ground-reaction loading. Includes heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops and snap-down landings from Bryan's bone health protocol.": "Gumugol ng 3-4 minuto sa pagpapasigla ng density ng mineral ng buto sa pamamagitan ng high-impact ground-rection loading. May kasamang heel drops at stomp drills, pogo hops at snap-down landings mula sa bone health protocol ni Bryan.",
  "Spend 8–10 minutes after each session on tech neck and forward shoulders. Use Bryan's string cue, band pull-aparts, face pulls and external rotation, plus his two physical-therapist exercises twice a week. Chin tucks and a doorway stretch are included as extras.": "Gumugol ng 8–10 minuto pagkatapos ng bawat session sa tech neck at forward shoulders. Gamitin ang string cue ni Bryan, band pull-aparts, face pulls at external rotation, kasama ang kanyang dalawang physical-therapist exercises dalawang beses sa isang linggo. Ang mga chin tuck at isang doorway stretch ay kasama bilang mga extra.",
