  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "Ang mga araw ng lakas ay kumukuha ng mga pangunahing kaalaman sa template (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) at idagdag ang kanyang signature Knees-Over-Toes at high-rep posture work.",
