  "Three demonstration videos for every exercise: two technique videos and one short, focused clip. When Bryan has a video it still opens first and stays the default.": "Tatlong demonstration video para sa bawat ehersisyo: dalawang technique na video at isang maikli at nakatutok na clip. Kapag may video si Bryan, nagbubukas pa rin muna ito at nananatiling default.",
