  "Tuesday, October 27": "Martes, Oktubre 27",
  "Tuesday, October 6": "Martes, Oktubre 6",
  "Tuesday: 4 brisk 20 s bursts. Thursday: 2 rounds of 2 min brisk, well below all-out.": "Martes: 4 brisk 20 s na pagsabog. Huwebes: 2 round ng 2 min na mabilis, mas mababa sa lahat.",
  "Tuesday: 8 × 20 s hard. Thursday: 3 rounds of 4 min, then 4.": "Martes: 8 × 20 s hard. Huwebes: 3 round ng 4 min, pagkatapos ay 4.",
  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "Martes: mabilis na 20 s na pagsabog na may mahabang pagbawi. Huwebes: 2 kinokontrol na pag-ikot ng 3 min, pagbuo sa 3 pag-ikot.",
  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Martes: Intervals 1 · 20 segundong pagsabog + Zone 2 + back & core",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Martes: dalawang bloke ng 8 × 20 s all-out. Huwebes: ang buong Norwegian 4×4 sa {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Martes: dalawang bloke ng 8 × 20 s all-out. Huwebes: ang buong Norwegian 4×4 sa 159–178 bpm.",
  "Turkish woman · warm": "babaeng Turkish · mainit",
