  "Voice coach": "Boses coach",
  "Voice coach has a Download voice button for any included voice that is not ready, with clip-by-clip progress. Downloading also starts automatically when coaching is already on, and Preview waits until the voice is ready.": "Ang voice coach ay may button na I-download ang boses para sa anumang kasamang boses na hindi pa handa, na may clip-by-clip na progreso. Awtomatikong magsisimula din ang pag-download kapag naka-on na ang coaching, at maghihintay ang Preview hanggang handa na ang boses.",
